---
description:
  Checks that subgraph titles which look like list headings (beginning with a
  number and a period, such as '1. first' and '2. second') parse correctly both
  when quoted and when left unquoted.
config:
  fontFamily: courier
---
graph TB
  subgraph "1. first"
  a1-->a2
  end
  subgraph 2. second
  b1-->b2
  end
